 "region": "Central Australia, Northern Territory",
 "author": "Rally Raid samples",
 "description": "Patterned after the Finke Desert Race (Alice Springs to Finke along the old Ghan corridor) and the old Australian Safari: a long, flat-out run south on the Old South Road's sand and gravel past Ewaninga to Maryvale. Little navigation (WPV / WPC), lots of speed, a community speed zone near the finish, WPS at washouts and whoops. Countdown start like the Finke prologue. (The track on to Finke itself is not routable in OSM's car profile, so this stage stops at Maryvale.)",
